<title>INDIA: INDIAN MONEY MARKET RATES - Jan 3 (1330 IST).</title>
<headline>INDIAN MONEY MARKET RATES - Jan 3 (1330 IST).</headline>
<text>
<p>Indicative market rates</p>
<p>* Call money:(O/N/)			 0.10-0.25  pct</p>
<p>* Commercial paper: P1+		  12.00-14.00 pct</p>
<p>* Commercial paper: P1		   13.50-15.00 pct</p>
<p>* Certificate of deposit: 90 day     12.00-13.50 pct</p>
<p>* Treasury bills:</p>
<p>  91  day t-bill			    8.20-8.40 pct</p>
<p>  364 day t-bill			   10.45-10.55 pct</p>
